# ===== Dialogue Character Editor top menu (Adobe style) =====
# ===== Menu titles =====
menu_type => Position
menu_char => Character
menu_anim => Animation
menu_view => View
menu_file => File
menu_help => Help

# ===== Status bar =====
status_side => Pos:
status_image => Image:
status_anim => Anim:
status_offset => Offset:
status_scale => Scale:

# ===== Items: Position menu =====
item_side_left => Align left
item_side_center => Align center
item_side_right => Align right

# ===== Items: Character menu =====
item_image => Image file
label_image => Image file
item_pos_x => Position offset X
label_pos_x => Position X
item_pos_y => Position offset Y
label_pos_y => Position Y
item_scale => Scale
label_scale => Scale
item_no_aa => Disable antialiasing
item_reload_image => Reload image
item_load_char => Load character JSON
item_save_char => Save character JSON

# ===== Items: Animation menu =====
item_anim => Expression
label_anim => Animation
item_anim_name => Animation name (JSON)
label_anim_name => Anim name
item_loop_name => Loop prefix (XML)
label_loop_name => Loop prefix
item_idle_name => Idle prefix (XML)
label_idle_name => Idle prefix
item_anim_add_update => Add / Update animation
item_anim_remove => Remove animation

# ===== Items: View menu =====
item_view_reset => Reset camera & display
item_view_bubble => Toggle speech bubble
item_view_ghost => Cycle ghosts (Loop / Idle / Off)

# ===== Items: File menu =====
item_load => Load character (JSON)
item_save => Save character (JSON)
item_exit => Exit editor

# ===== Descriptions =====
desc_side_left => Character & bubble aligned to the left side
desc_side_center => Character & bubble centered
desc_side_right => Character aligned to the right side
desc_image => Sparrow atlas/XML name of the portrait (under images/dialogue/)
desc_pos_x => Horizontal offset from the base position
desc_pos_y => Vertical offset from the base position
desc_scale => Overall character scale
desc_no_aa => Disable antialiasing for this character
desc_reload_image => Reload atlas & animations using the current image file
desc_load_char => Load a dialogue character JSON from disk
desc_save_char => Save the current character data as JSON
desc_anim => Pick an animation from the list to view/edit
desc_anim_name => Animation name used inside the character JSON
desc_loop_name => XML frame prefix of the looping segment
desc_idle_name => XML frame prefix of the idle/finish segment
desc_anim_add_update => Add a new animation; updates loop/idle prefixes when the name exists
desc_anim_remove => Remove the current animation entry
desc_view_reset => Reset camera zoom to 1x, reset content position and show HUD
desc_view_bubble => Show or hide the speech bubble preview
desc_view_ghost => Cycle ghost display: Loop ghost → Idle ghost → off
desc_load => Load a dialogue character JSON from disk
desc_save => Save the current character as a dialogue character JSON
desc_exit => Exit the dialogue character editor and return to the master editor menu (confirms when unsaved changes exist)

# ===== Help rows =====
item_help_keys => Offset nudging (Animation tab): WASD / Arrow keys
item_help_camera => Move camera: J K L I
item_help_zoom => Zoom camera: Q / E
item_help_shift => Hold Shift: offset steps x10
item_help_space => Replay current animation & text: SPACE
item_help_f1 => Open this help menu: F1
item_help_exit => Exit editor: ESC

# ===== Help row descriptions =====
desc_help_keys => On the Animation page: WASD = loop offset, Arrow keys = idle offset
desc_help_camera => Hold J/K/L/I to pan the camera (Shift moves 4x faster)
desc_help_zoom => Q zooms out, E zooms in (up to 1x)
desc_help_shift => While held, offset steps are multiplied by 10
desc_help_space => Replay the current animation and reset the dialogue typing
desc_help_f1 => Open this help menu: F1
desc_help_exit => Exit editor: ESC (confirms when unsaved changes exist)

# ===== Exit confirmation popup (overrides the shared keys in the editors group) =====
confirm_unsaved_title => Exit Dialogue Portrait Editor
confirm_unsaved_message => This portrait has unsaved changes. They will be lost if you exit. Discard them and exit?
